{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 17, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "愛", "id": "愛"}, {"form": "歸", "id": "歸"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "水", "id": "水"}, {"form": "求", "id": "求"}, {"form": "深", "id": "深"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "物", "id": "物"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "親", "id": "親"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.468099531471619, "source": "性", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 0.7453329337305156, "source": "性", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.9980959022258835, "source": "性", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.3049487216659381, "source": "性", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 0.9276544905244701, "source": "求", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.7749523509116738, "source": "求", "target": "水"}, {"weight": 2.180417459019838, "source": "求", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 1.5562631499468444, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "義", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.7104138297741025, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.5221893824163057, "source": "心", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 0.9276544905244701, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.180417459019838, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.5709795465857378, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.4872702784598928, "source": "深", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.8439452223986252, "source": "深", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.096708190893993, "source": "深", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 0.6399724180726892, "source": "仁", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.1507980418386798, "source": "仁", 